{
  "scenario_brief": "TEST: Ops scan\n\nA test floor for the ops core's first stage (OPS_CORE_PLAN.md, S1). One lobby with a drop box, a guest port and an office port, a wall switch and a note. Plug the box into the office port: the office network opens empty. Sweep it, scan a host, then sign in to the file server with the note's password and sweep the plant network that opens. Nothing to solve.",
